                "title": "Traditional Farmington Lever with Maguire Rosette",
                "description": "With its classic design, the Traditional Farmington Lever with Maguire Rosette is a great choice for historic homes. It is easy to install on a standard pre-drilled door. The Yale Expressions Farmington Lever with Maguire Rose is available as a dummy, passage function, privacy lever, and a keyed lever in several of the most popular finish colors.",
